        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Computer Graphics - Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Every rendered image is the answer to one question: *given a description of a 3D\nworld and a virtual camera, what color is each pixel?* Everything in this directory\nis a stage in answering it."
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#003",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:computer-graphics:00-overview, git-history:computer-graphics:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "computer-graphics/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[rendering pipeline, rasterization, ray tracing, scene graph, shading, display]",
        "current_path": "computer-graphics/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:computer-graphics:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "computer-graphics",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[computer graphics]",
        "section": "computer-graphics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Computer Graphics - Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                       THE RENDERING PIPELINE (scene -> pixels)               |\n|                                                                              |\n|  SCENE            GEOMETRY          VISIBILITY        SHADING        DISPLAY |\n|  -----            --------          ----------        -------        ------- |\n|                                                                              |\n| +---------+     +-----------+     +-----------+     +----------+   +-------+ |\n| | meshes  | --> | transform | --> | which     | --> | what     |-->| frame | |\n| | lights  |     | to clip   |     | surface   |     | color is |   | buffer| |\n| | camera  |     | space     |     | is seen   |     | it?      |   | -> sRGB| |\n| | materials|    | (M·V·P)   |     | per pixel?|     | (BRDF +  |   | -> mon | |\n| +---------+     +-----------+     +-----------+     |  lights) |   +-------+ |\n|     |                |                 |             +----------+      |     |\n|  [07,08]          [01]            [02 raster]          [04]        [08,09]   |\n|                                  [03 ray-trace]                              |\n|                                                                              |\n|  GPU executes transform + visibility + shading in parallel  [06]            |\n|  Textures feed material data into shading                   [05]            |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```"
    },
    {
